   "cooked": "<p>This period covers praise given between <strong>01 August 2022 and 11 September 2022</strong>. We allocated <strong>5628</strong> TEC tokens for rewards. Some praise accounts still haven’t been activated so the total amount below will be less than what we set aside to distribute.</p>\n<p>Out of the total rewards:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>90% of the tokens were given as praise rewards <img alt=\":pray:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/pray.png?v=10\" title=\":pray:\"/>\n</li>\n<li>7% distributed among quantifiers <img alt=\":balance_scale:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/balance_scale.png?v=10\" title=\":balance_scale:\"/>\n</li>\n<li>3% assigned to the reward board <img alt=\":memo:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/memo.png?v=10\" title=\":memo:\"/>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This data has been reviewed by the Quantifiers and the Reward Board, and has been submitted for distribution to the <a href=\"https://xdai.aragon.blossom.software/#/rewardboardtec/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Reward Board DAO</a></p>\n<p>You can check out the <a href=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/0xNuggan/tec-rewards/f6a1b3426c50750c8f7ec162a8d526e15291244f/distribution_rounds/round-17/distribution_results/reports/round-17--general-round-analysis-report.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">full period analysis here</a>. <img alt=\":bar_chart:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/bar_chart.png?v=10\" title=\":bar_chart:\"/></p>\n<p>The distribution will also include the <strong>fifth round of the retroactive sourcecred distributions.</strong> Check <a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/tec-rewards-distribution-june-2022-pt-1/1107/3\">this post</a> for more information.</p>\n<p>This post will be open to the community for review for 48 hours then submitted to the Reward Board for final execution. <img alt=\":heavy_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/heavy_check_mark.png?v=10\" title=\":heavy_check_mark:\"/></p>\n<p>The Rewards Distribution for this round is as follows:</p>\n<div class=\"md-table\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Username</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:right\">Rewards in TEC</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">natesuits#4789</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">447.801</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">enti#1546</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">302.74</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Irem#3362</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">292.673</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Zeptimus#3359</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">289.152</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">GideonRo#3175</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">281.156</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Tamarandom#9361</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">268.654</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">acidlazzer#5796</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">267.984</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Mount Manu#3530</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">241.136</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">bear100#9085</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">203.282</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">divine_comedian#5493</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">195.573</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">pat.zip (TE Academy)<span class=\"hashtag\">#5266</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">170.884</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">r-x-x#8344</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">162.191</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">kristofer#1475</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">155.316</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Juankbell#7458</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">118.605</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">eduardovegap#0422</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">